## Prior art and implementations

Prior art shows something works in practice. It never establishes correctness on its own —
pair it with a `datasheet` or `spec` citation (rule 20).

| Key | Title | Publisher | URL | Establishes | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `CIT-WISBLOCK-API2` | WisBlock-API-V2 | beegee-tokyo | https://github.com/beegee-tokyo/WisBlock-API-V2 | Event-driven Class A + power-save framework for RAK4631; the P0 stack recommendation in `LIBRARIES.md`. | UNVERIFIED |
| `CIT-SX126X-ARDUINO` | SX126x-Arduino | beegee-tokyo | https://github.com/beegee-tokyo/SX126x-Arduino | LoRaWAN MAC implementation underlying the RAK4631 Arduino path. | UNVERIFIED |
| `CIT-ONEWIRE-SERIAL` | RAK-OneWireSerial | beegee-tokyo | https://github.com/beegee-tokyo/RAK-OneWireSerial | Half-duplex one-wire Sensor Hub protocol — the alternate RAK9154 path. | UNVERIFIED |
| `CIT-MESHTASTIC-9154` | meshtastic/firmware `RAK9154Sensor` | Meshtastic | https://github.com/meshtastic/firmware | Working RAK9154 reader; nRF52 brownout lessons. | UNVERIFIED |
| `CIT-MODBUSMASTER` | ModbusMaster | 4-20ma | https://github.com/4-20ma/ModbusMaster | Arduino Modbus master with timeout handling. | UNVERIFIED |
| `CIT-RAK-SLEEP` | RAK4631 deep sleep until reset | RAKwireless forum | https://forum.rakwireless.com/t/rak4631-deep-sleep-until-reset/7253 | **`Serial.end()` is required before sleep** or the node holds ~mA indefinitely. The most common failure mode for this class of node. | UNVERIFIED |

## Sibling repositories (local)

Local paths move and these repos advance independently, so **cite a commit SHA**.

| Key | Repo | Path | Establishes | Pinned |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `CIT-FWM-DECODER` | forest-weather-machines | `LoRaWAN/payload/rak-wx-station-default.js` | The live TTN uplink formatter — the other half of the payload contract. Channel/type map, `WIND_DIR_OFFSET = 230`, zero-wind null policy. | `efc0e3c` (2026-07-30) |
| `CIT-FWM-RAK2560` | forest-weather-machines | `LoRaWAN/docs/RAK2560_weather_station_settings.md` | Field-proven RK900 and BMS Modbus settings from the deployed Sensor Hub. | `efc0e3c` |
| `CIT-RAK45WIRE` | forest-weather-machines | `rak-4-5-wire/` | RAK9154 connector reference and bench reverse-engineering, including the one-wire POC. | `efc0e3c` |

Clone location on both machines: `~/Documents/GitHub/forest-weather-machines`.
Override for tooling with `FWM_REPO=/path/to/repo`.
